OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged with student's murder
OL,4,Aafter stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a student was fatally stabbed.
OL,9,FVijay Kumar, an Indian national who was
OL,10,Fstudying in Bristol, was found by
OL,11,Fpolice officers with serious injuries
OL,12,Fon Barbourne Road, Worcester, at around
OL,13,F04:15 GMT on 25 November.
OL,15,FThe 30-year-old later died at Queen
OL,16,FElizabeth Hospital in Birmingham.
OL,18,FVanch Vansh, 23, of Heather Road in
OL,19,FSmethwick, West Midlands, and Harsh
OL,20,FKapahi, 27, of Gregorys Mill Street in
OL,21,FWorcester, have been charged with
OL,22,Fmurder.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
